{"type":"message","id":"f28a6df3","parentId":"a21ced5d","timestamp":"2026-05-18T11:01:08.247Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_EwS53VnasBbuSlpQHYZ54mFD","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"primary_headline\": \"Trump warns Iran 'clock is ticking' as peace talks stall\",\n  \"topic_theme\": \"US-Iran nuclear and regional war negotiations\",\n  \"combined_key_facts\": [\n    \"BBC reports Trump said Iran\\u2019s response to the latest US proposal was not moving fast enough, warning there would not be much left if talks failed.\",\n    \"Iran said it had responded through Pakistani mediators and that exchanges with Washington were still continuing, but both sides remained far apart.\",\n    \"The reporting ties the stalled diplomacy to wider regional escalation, including Israeli strikes, pressure over Hezbollah, and US-led sanctions and naval blockade measures.\",\n    \"Iran\\u2019s leverage includes the Strait of Hormuz, a critical oil and LNG shipping route; disruption there has already pushed global oil prices higher.\"\n  ],\n  \"source_urls\": [\n    \"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cd0p4y9y48xo\",\n    \"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/5/18/video-us-calls-on-g7-to-impose-us-led-sanctions-on-iran?traffic_source=rss\",\n    \"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/5/18/hantavirus-hit-cruise-ship-docks-in-the-netherlands?traffic_source=rss\"\n  ],\n  \"chart_coin\": \"bitcoin\"\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779102068247}}
